    "text": "The simple pendulum&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> of mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></msub></math>&nbsp;and length&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>l</mi></math> is suspended from the trolley&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> of mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msub></math>. If the system is released from rest at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, determine the velocity <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msub></math>&nbsp;of the trolley. Friction is negligible.<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0065_9648295451b3.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 273px; height: 227px;\" />"
